the job around then. Dr. Sartain would follow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:39.420
a path similar to his teacher, but his obsession&nbsp;
with Michael Myers would eventually go too far. If&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:44.040
you want to know how Dr. Sartain's obsession with&nbsp;
his patient compares but also greatly differs from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:48.360
his mentor, Dr. Samuel Loomis, just how common it&nbsp;
is for doctors to become obsessed with their own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:53.040
patients, and what drove Dr. Sartain to attempt&nbsp;
murder, stick around to the end of this video.&nbsp;&nbsp;

