00:03:29.311 --> 00:03:35.400
In 1930, a physician by the name of Carl Tanzler&nbsp;
encountered a patient named Maria Elena Milagro&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.358
de Hoyos, or as I'll be calling her from&nbsp;
now on, Dear Maria. ♪ I got your picture ♪

