- When she came into the hospital that Dr. Tanzler&nbsp;
worked at, there was an immediate attraction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:48.060
but sadly for her, she was there due to&nbsp;
tuberculosis, which was often fatal at that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:52.980
time. Tanzler immediately became infatuated with&nbsp;
her, despite her technically being married, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

