00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:39.420
- With no conclusions drawn after 40 years,&nbsp;
Michael was set to be transferred to a new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:43.980
facility, Glass Hill, and assigned a new doctor,&nbsp;
which Dr. Sartain obviously isn't pleased with.

