- Glass Hill is a pit of hell.&nbsp;
For years, he's been kept here&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:50.670
to be studied. I suppose the state has lost&nbsp;
interest in discovering anything further.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:55.080
- I can imagine that at this point, he lost&nbsp;
hope, because his entire life's work was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:59.220
about to be for nothing. That is, until he was&nbsp;
approached by British investigative journalists&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:03.420
Aaron Korey and Dana Haines. They wanted to&nbsp;
speak with Michael, which Sartain saw as a&nbsp;&nbsp;

