00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:56.551
to save her, and Sartain refuses to give up on&nbsp;
Michael, even after losing authority over him.

00:07:56.551 --> 00:08:00.000
- Michael Myers is still my patient&nbsp;
until he's in somebody else's care,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.771 --> 00:08:02.557
so I'm seeing my duty through 'til the end.

00:08:02.557 --> 00:08:07.020
- [Zac] In the late night of October 30th, Michael&nbsp;
overtook the bus to escape into the wild.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:11.340
It's likely that Dr. Sartain played a part in&nbsp;
helping Michael get free. As Michael got away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.360
he attacked two guards and the bus driver,&nbsp;
with Sartain being left alive but stranded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:19.140
on the bus in handcuffs... for some reason.&nbsp;
The doctor likely saw this as the two of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:22.920
them having some kind of bond or silent&nbsp;
agreement. He would help Michael go free,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:26.700
