out to investigate, and the boy shoots Sartain in&nbsp;
the shoulder, despite Sartain literally saying...

00:08:34.918 --> 00:08:36.000
- Don't shoot! Aah!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.540
- Sartain is discovered later by&nbsp;
Deputy Hawkins. Barely conscious,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:43.920
he's able to utter out the words "Did he escape?",&nbsp;
illustrating his top priority before falling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:48.420
unconscious. He's rushed to the hospital in the&nbsp;
early morning of October 31st. The police would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:52.380
like to question him about the incident, but&nbsp;
nurses inform them that he lost too much blood,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:57.300
