Ramsland, PhD, these fans get the delusion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:29.160
that they're special to the person so that if&nbsp;
the person escaped, he or she wouldn't harm the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:33.420
fan. Ramsland attributes this to narcissism.&nbsp;
Given the fact that Michael chose not to kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:37.440
Sartain on the bus and the fact that he tries to&nbsp;
comfort Michael prior to the patient transfer-

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.414
- Don't worry, Michael. I'll be by your side.

00:10:40.414 --> 00:10:45.180
- it seems like Sartain probably has the same&nbsp;
delusions that serial killer pen pals do. It&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:48.180
