due to spending so much time around him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:51.720
like the countless stories of zookeepers&nbsp;
who let their guard down around dangerous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.720 --> 00:10:57.240
animals. Whatever the reason, it would not be long&nbsp;
before Sartain had a wild encounter of his own.&nbsp;&nbsp;

